
  <sn><md>### Cloud-to-Cloud Synchronization

Cloud-to-cloud synchronization means transferring or synchronizing files directly from **one cloud storage service to another** using rclone.

For example:

```text
☁️ Google Drive ─────────────► ☁️ MEGA
```

Rclone handles the transfer between the two cloud remotes.
</md></sn>
